{"4653900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Roadtrip!", "steam_appid": 4653900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roadtrip! is an asymmetric first-person multiplayer party game where one player controls the exhausted Dad while the other players control mischievous Kids trying to sabotage the family vacation with increasingly ridiculous schemes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive across procedurally generated roads filled with random events, roadside attractions, disasters, and opportunities for chaos. Stop at gas stations to prepare for whatever comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever you do, do not crash the car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653900/extras/b23c703dda0e2ee9c5b08879b9d2eb46.poster.avif?t=1778452365\" width=444 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653900/extras/b23c703dda0e2ee9c5b08879b9d2eb46.webm?t=1778452365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653900/extras/b23c703dda0e2ee9c5b08879b9d2eb46.mp4?t=1778452365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEEP THE TRIP TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Dad and make sure the Kids do not complete their crazy schemes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive fast and drive safely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage money, fuel, and supplies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop the Kids before their plans escalate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confiscate suspicious items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put the Kids in timeout</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach Grandma’s house before the trip falls apart</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653900/extras/05a48da88affdc099598fab4b764db86.poster.avif?t=1778452365\" width=444 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653900/extras/05a48da88affdc099598fab4b764db86.webm?t=1778452365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653900/extras/05a48da88affdc099598fab4b764db86.mp4?t=1778452365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAUSE CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of the Kids and work against Dad:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull pranks and create distractions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak suspicious items into the car to use against Dad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore gas stations and roadside attractions for new ways to torment Dad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn minor problems into catastrophic disasters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together on ridiculous schemes against Dad to end the trip your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653900/extras/96d3d118526e365a2c1a1b9b3b7be6d8.poster.avif?t=1778452365\" width=444 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653900/extras/96d3d118526e365a2c1a1b9b3b7be6d8.webm?t=1778452365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653900/extras/96d3d118526e365a2c1a1b9b3b7be6d8.mp4?t=1778452365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY STOP IS A SANDBOX</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each roadside stop is filled with opportunities for both sides:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dad maintains the car</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kids gather items for their schemes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play arcade games for tickets and prizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy tools, toys, snacks, and suspicious contraband</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653900/extras/a8af9f8a49aba3d24d2d4f48623dd8b1.poster.avif?t=1778452365\" width=444 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653900/extras/a8af9f8a49aba3d24d2d4f48623dd8b1.webm?t=1778452365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653900/extras/a8af9f8a49aba3d24d2d4f48623dd8b1.mp4?t=1778452365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROADTRIPS NEVER GO AS PLANNED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive pranks against Dad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smuggling contraband into the car</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foiling the Kids’ plans and confiscating their items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escaping timeout through minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless backseat pestering</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative sibling chaos over voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disasters, terrible decisions and infighting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653900/extras/3cbfd742d65b790c22e7c5edee743328.poster.avif?t=1778452365\" width=444 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653900/extras/3cbfd742d65b790c22e7c5edee743328.webm?t=1778452365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653900/extras/3cbfd742d65b790c22e7c5edee743328.mp4?t=1778452365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asymmetric online multiplayer gameplay with voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Dad vs up to 3 Kids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated roads, maps, and roadside locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deceptions, distractions, and hidden schemes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable sandbox encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic random events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ridiculous items and interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dad has to complete the trip in time to win</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kids need to complete multi-step schemes to win<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653900/extras/da499ec9ac9a629ca83e2b6841a6daf6.poster.avif?t=1778452365\" width=444 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653900/extras/da499ec9ac9a629ca83e2b6841a6daf6.webm?t=1778452365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653900/extras/da499ec9ac9a629ca83e2b6841a6daf6.mp4?t=1778452365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Reveal Trailer</i> <i>Music: Pink Sidewalks by El DePravo</i></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roadtrip! is an asymmetric first-person multiplayer party game wh